      "value": "@{5f3046762b921879a5151868|full_name}: Gotcha.\nThe intent of the converter is not to be a perfect, 1:1 conversation. It is meant to be \"good enough\" for most setups. If you desire something more detailed or to get a specific effect, it is expected that you have to go and manually convert (or at least, tweak the auto-conversion) in the SDK.\nThis seems to be one of those cases. \nWith that in mind, that's likely where I think this will end up-- it's less that PhysBones is broken or incorrect, and more that the settings are necessarily different.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
